  "description": "A flexible, configurable RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) library for .NET. Supports multiple embedding providers (Ollama, LM Studio, OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, ONNX, HTTP) and vector stores (SQLite-vec, PostgreSQL/pgvector, Qdrant). Built-in document processors for PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, CSV, HTML, Markdown, JSON, TOML, and code files.",
